Otium: credits

Everything in this game was made for it: code, the map and its relief, the
towns, carts and galleys, the procedural textures (textures.c, made at load
time) and the synthesized sound and music (tools/make-audio.mjs). The
exceptions are the fonts below. City positions and coastlines follow real
geography (traced by hand in map.c).

